      "worked_solution": "Since $∠CBD≅∠ABD$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠CBD & =m∠ABD \\\\ 3x+{5}^{∘} & =6x-{19}^{∘} \\\\ 3x+{24}^{∘} & =6x \\\\ {24}^{∘} & =3x \\\\ {8}^{∘} & =x \\\\ x & ={8}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, by the angle addition postulate,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠ABC & =m∠CBD+m∠ABD \\\\  & =2(m∠CBD) \\\\  & =2(3({8}^{∘})+{5}^{∘}) \\\\  & ={58}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
